* {{lien|black bean|en}}
* {{lien|green bean|en}}
* {{lien|haricot bean|en}}
* {{lien|kidney bean|en}}
* {{lien|lima bean|en}}
* {{lien|navy bean|en}}
* {{lien|soya bean|en}}
* {{lien|string bean|en}}
* {{lien|yam bean|en}}
{{)}}

==== {{S|dérivés}} ====
